7n"},"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":42,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTU4MDU4MjYzMjE3NDc5Njg=","text":"理系の仕事と進路のヒントに出会う。\n\n✧ 女子中高生 ×理工系分野出身の女性技官・女性自衛官 ✧\n \n8月25日、「Girls Meet STEM」を防衛省で開催し、82名の女子中高生にご参加いただきました！\n \n市ヶ谷のオフィス見学後の懇談では、理工系分野出身の女性技官や女性自衛官が、参加者からの質問に応じて、自身の進路選択の決め手や学生時代の経験、仕事のやりがいについて語り、活発な意見交換がされました。\n \n理工系分野には様々な学び方や働き方があります。\n本イベントが、参加者の皆さんが自身の将来を考えるきっかけとなれば幸いです。"}}},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":127},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1182494221720145920/1f6PGrY1_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/268732024/1693473523"},"core":{"created_at":"Sat Mar 19 10:39:03 +0000 2011","name":"防衛省・自衛隊","screen_name":"ModJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNjg3MzIwMjQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区市谷本村町5-1"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"#防衛省・自衛隊 の公式アカウントです。防衛省の政策や各種活動などの最新情報を発信します。英語による発信▸ @ModJapan_en 災害派遣等の発信▸ @ModJapan_saigai 【Facebook】https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J 【Instagram】 https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"facebook.com/mod.japn","expanded_url":"http://facebook.com/mod.japn","indices":[104,127],"url":"https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J"},{"display_url":"Instagram.com/modjapan","expanded_url":"http://Instagram.com/modjapan","indices":[140,163],"url":"https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ"}]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp","expan