目標を達成できるよう、政府の支援パッケージに基づき、財政支援・人的支援・技術的支援により、被災自治体を包括的に支援してまいります。","id_str":"2095740216489525674","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","quote_count":0,"quoted_status_id_str":"2095739725760098363","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/kantei/status/…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/kantei/status/2095739725760098363","url":"https://t.co/QJ2Px4SO6u"},"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":6,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"286056244"},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1929442960221028353/I0KsGLtz_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/412940784/1464569515"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Nov 15 09:24:43 +0000 2011","name":"首相官邸","screen_name":"kantei"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo0MTI5NDA3ODQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":""},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":false},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"professional":{"category":[],"professional_type":"Business","rest_id":"1589269994889957377"},"profile_bio":{"description":"本アカウントは首相官邸の公式アカウントです。日々の総理に関する情報や内閣の重要政策についての情報などをお届けします。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp","expanded_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/","indices":[0,23],"url":"https://t.co/lKMociTte5"}]}}},"profile_description_language":"ja","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_metadata":{"profile_interstitial_type":""},"profile_translation":{"translator_type":"none"},"relationship_counts":{"followers":1758078,"following":47},"relationship_perspectives":{"blocked_by":false,"blocking":false,"followed_by":false,"following":false,"live_following":false,"muting":false},"